'''At Attin Middle School Gamma''' was a school for [[Youngling|young]] students on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]]. The students donned school [[Clothing|uniforms]] featuring an [[Aurebesh]] badge that displayed "AT ATTIN" at the top and "MIDDLE SCHOOL GAMMA" at the bottom; nevertheless, the sign affixed to the school building stated "AT-ATTIN MIDDLE SCHOOL" (including a hyphen). The school was attended by [[Wim]], [[Neel]], [[Roona (individual)|Roona]], [[KB]], and [[Fern]]. The students had to take an exam called the [[Career Assessment Test]], and there were [[safety droid|safety droids]] working there.<ref name="Real Adventure" />

The roof of the school housed a [[turbolaser]] concealed under a collapsible dome when not in usage. Neel located this turbolaser, utilising knowledge he gained of one existing upon the ruins of an identical school on the planet [[At Achrann]], activated it and fired it against [[Silvo's pirate frigate]] during the [[Invasion of At Attin|invasion]] of At Attin in 9 ABY. The turbolaser was then destroyed by the frigate's retaliatory fire.<ref name="SC6" />

